---

<V2Layout
  title="Use Cases | Myrmec"
  description="How organisations apply Myrmec: governed ops copilots, NL→SQL analysts, compliance Q&A, code generation, incident analysis, and more."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-5xl">Use Cases</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
      Every scenario below runs on the same governed runtime — grounded retrieval, sandboxed
      execution, approval-gated action, full audit trail.
    </p>

    <!-- ─── INTERACTIVE SESSIONS ─────────────────────────────── -->
    <h2 class="mt-14 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Interactive sessions</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Conversational steering, grounded retrieval, sandboxed execution, approval-gated action.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {sessions.map((s) => (
        <article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">{s.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">{s.body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- ─── ENGINEERING & CODE ───────────────────────────────── -->
    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Engineering &amp; code</h2>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-7 md:grid-cols-2">
      {engineering.map(([title, desc]) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">{title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">{desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- ─── OPERATIONS & BUSINESS ────────────────────────────── -->
    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Operations &amp; business</h2>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-7 md:grid-cols-2">
      {operations.map(([title, desc]) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">{title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">{desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="mt-16 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50/60 p-8 text-center">
      <p class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-800">See how these would run in your organisation.</p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/v2/get-started" class="rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-500">Get Started</a>
        <a href="/v2/#contact" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:border-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-600">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</V2Layout>
